# E2178 - OHOS target linker runtime libraries need compiler-relative LD_LIBRARY_PATH
id:                     E2178
trigger_tool:           clang|lld|conan
phase:                  conan-build|target-link
error_signature:        Error loading shared library libxml2.so.16|Error relocating.*lld|unable to execute command
severity:               2
category:               ohos|toolchain|linker|runtime
match_keywords:         target linker runtime, compiler-relative library path, llvm/bin, llvm/lib, LD_LIBRARY_PATH, missing shared library
title:                  OHOS target linker invocations need compiler-relative runtime binding
root_cause:              An OHOS worker may invoke the target clang from an SDK whose lld binary depends on shared libraries under the same LLVM installation. If the worker environment does not expose that SDK runtime directory, clang can compile objects but lld fails before producing the target ELF.
affected_scope:         Windows-hosted or POSIX-worker Conan cross builds that invoke an OHOS SDK compiler and linker from a task-controlled path.
verification_cmd:       env LD_LIBRARY_PATH=<llvm-bin>:<llvm-lib> <target-clang> ... -o <target>; read the linker stderr and verify the output ELF exists
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:            compiler-relative-linker-runtime
rec_description:        Derive runtime directories from the exact target compiler path and prepend them only for target compiler invocations. Preserve the existing environment, keep Windows handling separate, and fail if the linker still cannot load a dependency; do not copy shared libraries into global system directories.
rec_command:            LD_LIBRARY_PATH=<compiler-dir>:<compiler-parent>/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH <target-compiler> <args>
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               target-command-runtime-prefix
forbid_1_pattern:       copy.*libxml2.*system|modify.*global.*LD_LIBRARY_PATH
forbid_1_reason:        Shared system changes cross task boundaries and can hide the actual SDK closure.
forbid_1_consequence:   Other builds become non-reproducible or load the wrong ABI.
forbid_2_pattern:       compile.*PASS.*without.*link|ignore.*lld.*error
forbid_2_reason:        Object compilation does not prove that the target linker can run or that an ELF was produced.
forbid_2_consequence:   The recipe reports success without a target binary.
principles:             P006,P010,P014
causes:                 []
caused_by:              []
similar_to:             []
conflicts_with:         []
prerequisite_of:        []
doc_file:               doc/E2178.md
last_updated:           2026-09-04
source_event:           scdoc/1.11.3 PR #8252 CI #39466 target lld libxml2 runtime failure
source_pr:              pending
